{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於2026年11月23日16:45發出特別天氣提示，預測一股東北季候風將於明早（11月24日）影響廣東沿岸。本港天氣將轉吹偏北強風，逐步轉涼並伴有幾陣雨，初時雨勢較為頻密。市民應注意天氣變化，攜帶雨具並穿著保暖衣物以應對降溫情況。\n</p>\n<p>星期三及星期四早晚天氣清涼，市區最低氣溫約16度，新界地區則可能再低兩至三度。受天文大潮及東北季候風共同影響，預料星期三晚上沿岸水位將較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。居住在低窪地區的市民需提高警覺，提前做好防水措施。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民密切留意最新天氣資訊，並採取必要的安全措施以應對即將到來的天氣變化。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e9%a0%90%e5%a0%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣預報</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:43:51.407642+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:31.924357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:37:23.551722+00:00","content_hash":"fa00a45d4701e5e8c90b4b20ebba934267604fb6884bd295a4aaf0dd0595d4d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}